# @NAME@

<!-- What this project is, in one or two sentences. -->

## Build, run, test

```powershell
cmake --preset msvc-debug
cmake --build --preset msvc-debug --target @NAME@
.\build\msvc-debug\bin\@NAME@.exe
ctest --preset msvc-debug -R "^@NAME@:"
```

## Layout

| Path                      | Content                                                        |
| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `include/@NAME@/`         | Public headers of the library `@NAME@_lib`                     |
| `src/`                    | Library code, and `main.cpp` for the executable `@NAME@`       |
| `tests/`                  | doctest tests (`@NAME@_tests`)                                 |
| `docs/adr/`               | Decisions specific to this project, created with the first one |

ADRs use the repository template, [`docs/adr/0000-template.md`](../../docs/adr/0000-template.md).
